    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 306 of the laws of 2011, authorizing owners of\nresidential real property in high risk brush fire areas in the borough of\nStaten Island to cut and remove reeds from their property, in relation to\nextending the expiration and repeal date thereof for an additional year",
